        "padding_bottom": 52
      }
    },
    "rich_text_KaQxnw": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_rXpewP": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>What Makes the Snarky Pets Cat Cube Stand Out</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_zht9aM": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>After testing dozens of cubes and tents, here are the details that make this particular cube shine:</p><ul><li><br/><strong>Generous Entrance Hole:</strong> A 14-inch diameter opening makes it comfortable even for larger or “chonky” cats. No crouching or squeezing required.<br/></li><li><br/><strong>Connectivity:</strong> Zippered edges allow it to connect seamlessly to Snarky Pets’ Cat Tunnel, so your cat gets extended play space or a modular combo layout.<br/></li><li><br/><strong>Collapsible & Lightweight:</strong> Pop-open design, fold-flat storage. Great for setups that need flexibility or for people who move things around often.<br/></li><li><br/><strong>Sleek, Neutral Style:</strong> Grey/black tones blend with most interiors; no loud colors or pet-only aesthetics. Looks good even when it’s just sitting in your living room.<br/></li><li><br/><strong>Mesh Ventilation:</strong> Ensures airflow and helps reduce odor or humidity buildup. Also allows your cat to peek outside, which many enjoy.</li></ul>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_rXpewP",
        "text_zht9aM"
      ],
