    "rich_text_7GJRRB": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_Q6cWLY": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>Key Benefits You’ll Notice Quickly</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_faMV36": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Faster Calm for Anxious Cats</strong> – I’ve fostered nervous cats who didn’t rest comfortably until given a cube hideout. Once they had one, behavior softened.<br/><strong>Reduced Furniture Damage</strong> – Cats often abandon couch arms or curtains once they have an appealing alternative.<br/><strong>Room for Play + Rest</strong> – They dash in, retreat, nap, and observe—without needing multiple pieces of furniture.<br/><strong>Cleaner, Neater Look</strong> – Compared to big cat trees or overly bright beds, a cube adds function without clutter.<br/><strong>Easy Clean & Maintain</strong> – Light enough to move; mesh lets you spot clean; collapsible for storage on busy days.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_Q6cWLY",
        "text_faMV36"
      ],
