    "rich_text_wVWxnC": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_xVMrXT": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>FAQs</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_G6zn6q": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>1. Can big cats comfortably fit in this Cat Cube?</strong><br/>Yes. With a 14-inch entrance and roomy interior (~24×22×20 in), it’s designed to accommodate larger cats so they can enter, stretch, and move comfortably without strain.</p><p><strong>2. Is the cube safe to leave out all the time?</strong><br/>For indoor use—absolutely. It’s stable, ventilated, and safe. If you connect it to a tunnel, ensure transitions are smooth and that zippers are secure. Rotate its position occasionally and clean regularly.</p><p><strong>3. How do I clean or store this Cat Cube when not in use?</strong><br/>Spot clean with gentle soap, avoid soaking mesh. Fully air dry before storage. It collapses flat, so fold it up and stash it in a closet or under furniture to save space.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
